    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "The public hearing was adjourned.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "UC-kpvvm-hQ",
        "ts": "0:33:24",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T05:04:39.096Z",
        "endTs": "0:33:54"
      },
      "body": "County Council Public Hearing"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "Bill 164 CD1 would change a 163.443-acre portion of a parcel from Agriculture to Business Multifamily in the Wailuku-Kahului Community Plan.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "UC-kpvvm-hQ",
        "ts": "0:32:14",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T05:04:39.096Z",
        "endTs": "0:32:44"
      },
      "body": "County Council Public Hearing"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "Close public testimony on Bill 163 CD1: The Council closed public testimony on Bill 163 CD1 and accepted written testimony with no objections.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "UC-kpvvm-hQ",
        "ts": "0:32:08",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T05:04:39.096Z",
        "endTs": "0:32:38"
      },
      "body": "County Council Public Hearing"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "A testifier said he wants the housing built but that it could be done elsewhere with less impact.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "UC-kpvvm-hQ",
        "ts": "0:30:00",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T05:04:39.096Z",
        "endTs": "0:30:30"
      },
      "body": "County Council Public Hearing"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "A testifier said other land already approved for building is available near the old Dunes restaurant and the Maui Lani project.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "UC-kpvvm-hQ",
        "ts": "0:29:43",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T05:04:39.096Z",
        "endTs": "0:30:13"
      },
      "body": "County Council Public Hearing"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "A testifier said there would be no backup water supply if the project's single well stopped working.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "UC-kpvvm-hQ",
        "ts": "0:28:07",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T05:04:39.096Z",
        "endTs": "0:28:37"
      },
      "body": "County Council Public Hearing"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "He said the water supply is not certain because the project would use one well that is not yet properly tested.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "UC-kpvvm-hQ",
        "ts": "0:27:54",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T05:04:39.096Z",
        "endTs": "0:28:24"
      },
      "body": "County Council Public Hearing"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "A testifier said he hoped a school would be built to serve the 700 to 800 children in the new community.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "UC-kpvvm-hQ",
        "ts": "0:27:49",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T05:04:39.096Z",
        "endTs": "0:28:19"
      },
      "body": "County Council Public Hearing"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "He said the site is very close to the end of the runway.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "UC-kpvvm-hQ",
        "ts": "0:25:43",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T05:04:39.096Z",
        "endTs": "0:26:13"
      },
      "body": "County Council Public Hearing"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "A testifier said acting now is premature because the final environmental impact statement (EIS, a study of a project's effects) is not done.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "UC-kpvvm-hQ",
        "ts": "0:25:22",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T05:04:39.096Z",
        "endTs": "0:25:52"
      },
      "body": "County Council Public Hearing"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "Bill 163 CD1 would add a 163.443-acre portion of a parcel to the Maui Island Plan's urban growth boundary (the area planned for growth).",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "UC-kpvvm-hQ",
        "ts": "0:24:09",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T05:04:39.096Z",
        "endTs": "0:24:39"
      },
      "body": "County Council Public Hearing"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "Close public testimony at the beginning of the public hearing: The Council closed opening public testimony and accepted written testimony with no objections.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "UC-kpvvm-hQ",
        "ts": "0:24:01",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T05:04:39.096Z",
        "endTs": "0:24:31"
      },
      "body": "County Council Public Hearing"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "A caller said he would support the project if it were for people under 30% of the AMI (area median income).",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "UC-kpvvm-hQ",
        "ts": "0:22:00",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T05:04:39.096Z",
        "endTs": "0:22:30"
      },
      "body": "County Council Public Hearing"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "Another testifier said changing the zoning would be great.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "UC-kpvvm-hQ",
        "ts": "0:20:50",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T05:04:39.096Z",
        "endTs": "0:21:20"
      },
      "body": "County Council Public Hearing"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "A caller said the Clerk's Office did a poor job telling the public what this hearing was about.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "UC-kpvvm-hQ",
        "ts": "0:15:39",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T05:04:39.096Z",
        "endTs": "0:16:16"
      },
      "body": "County Council Public Hearing"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "A council member told a second testifier the bills were not about the overnight parking proposal she read about.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "UC-kpvvm-hQ",
        "ts": "0:14:12",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T05:04:39.096Z",
        "endTs": "0:14:42"
      },
      "body": "County Council Public Hearing"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "The first testifier asked council members to look closely at water use and land use.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "UC-kpvvm-hQ",
        "ts": "0:06:16",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T05:04:39.096Z",
        "endTs": "0:06:46"
      },
      "body": "County Council Public Hearing"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "The first testifier asked where the water for the development would come from.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "UC-kpvvm-hQ",
        "ts": "0:05:10",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T05:04:39.096Z",
        "endTs": "0:05:40"
      },
      "body": "County Council Public Hearing"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "The Council held a public hearing on Bills 163 CD1 and 164 CD1.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "UC-kpvvm-hQ",
        "ts": "0:00:29",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T05:04:39.096Z",
        "endTs": "0:00:59"
      },
      "body": "County Council Public Hearing"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-31",
      "text": "Committee Chair Tamara Paltin announced the public hearing on the Maui Island Plan and Wailuku-Kahului Community Plan amendments for Hoʻonani Village.",
      "basis": "reported",
      "source": {
        "type": "county-release",
        "url": "https://mauicounty.us/press-release/public-hearing-scheduled-thursday-for-ho%CA%BBonani-village-affordable-housing-project/",
        "publisher": "County of Maui",
        "quote": "A public hearing on bills to update the Maui Island Plan and Wailuku-Kahului Community Plan for Central Maui's Hoʻonani Village Mixed Use Development is scheduled for Thursday at 4:30 p.m. online and in the Council Chamber, Councilmember Tamara Paltin announced today.",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-25T01:47:00.291Z"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-06-19",
      "text": "A public hearing on Bill 163 is to be held on Maui before second and final reading.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "lLsXXrEBmuw",
        "ts": "0:36:14",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T18:09:11.606Z",
        "endTs": "0:36:44"
      },
      "body": "County Council Meeting"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-06-19",
      "text": "The bills would change the land's community plan designation from agriculture to business and multi-family.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "lLsXXrEBmuw",
        "ts": "0:36:01",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T18:09:11.606Z",
        "endTs": "0:36:31"
      },
      "body": "County Council Meeting"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-06-19",
      "text": "The council is considering bills to allow the Hoʻonani Village mixed-use project on 163.443 acres in Kahului.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "lLsXXrEBmuw",
        "ts": "0:35:35",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T18:09:11.606Z",
        "endTs": "0:36:29"
      },
      "body": "County Council Meeting"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-06-19",
      "text": "A testifier asked the council to wait for a final environmental impact statement before acting on Bills 163 and 164.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "lLsXXrEBmuw",
        "ts": "0:26:32",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T18:09:11.606Z",
        "endTs": "0:27:58"
      },
      "body": "County Council Meeting"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-05-20",
      "text": "The Disaster Recovery, International Affairs, and Planning Committee recommended first-reading passage of Bills 163 and 164 (Committee Report 26-34) but held back companion zoning Bill 165 pending Land Use Commission review.",
      "basis": "reported",
      "source": {
        "type": "other",
        "url": "https://www.mauinews.com/news/local-news/2026/06/hoonani-village-mixed-use-development-gains-council-support/",
        "publisher": "The Maui News",
        "quote": "The committee held back Bill 165 proposing a change in zoning, pending a review by the state Land Use Commission.",
